    "SIGNIFICANT (unresolved from Round 4) — EMNLP venue scope vs approach inconsistency: The target_venues description states 'realistic for a theory + pilot-scale submission with 500-instance SWE-bench Verified training and SWE-bench-Live Lite eval,' but the approach section describes a 5,300-instance training corpus (2,294 SWE-bench full + ~3,000 GitBugs pseudo-labeled). These are directly contradictory in the same document. Round 4 explicitly flagged this and asked for a coherent pilot story. It remains unresolved in Round 5.",
